{"engine":"say","voice":"Zosia","lang":"pl","book":"mark","ch":4,"moods":{"storm":"storm"},"beats":[{"sid":"lake","bi":0,"file":"00.mp3","dur":6.051,"text":"Ewangelia według świętego Marka. Rozdział czwarty. Przypowieści nad jeziorem i cisza po burzy.","words":[],"title":true},{"sid":"lake","bi":1,"file":"01.mp3","dur":4.509,"text":"Znowu zaczął nauczać nad jeziorem i bardzo wielki tłum ludzi zebrał się przy Nim.","words":[[0,0.334],[0.334,0.721],[0.721,1.162],[1.162,1.388],[1.388,1.883],[1.883,2.002],[2.002,2.389],[2.389,2.777],[2.777,3.056],[3.056,3.39],[3.39,3.777],[3.777,4.003],[4.003,4.283],[4.283,4.509]]},{"sid":"lake","bi":2,"file":"02.mp3","dur":5.782,"text":"Dlatego wszedł do łodzi i usiadł w niej pozostając na jeziorze, a cały lud stał na brzegu jeziora.","words":[[0,0.45],[0.45,0.845],[0.845,1.02],[1.02,1.361],[1.361,1.481],[1.481,1.876],[1.876,1.997],[1.997,2.282],[2.282,2.897],[2.897,3.072],[3.072,3.577],[3.795,3.919],[3.919,4.211],[4.211,4.446],[4.446,4.738],[4.738,4.918],[4.918,5.322],[5.322,5.782]]},{"sid":"lake","bi":3,"file":"03.mp3","dur":3.282,"text":"Uczył ich wiele w przypowieściach i mówił im w swojej nauce:","words":[[0,0.327],[0.327,0.549],[0.549,0.876],[0.876,0.992],[0.992,1.847],[1.847,1.963],[1.963,2.29],[2.29,2.459],[2.459,2.575],[2.575,2.955],[2.955,3.282]]},{"sid":"lake","bi":4,"file":"04.mp3","dur":0.897,"text":"«Słuchajcie:","words":[[0,0.897]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":0,"file":"05.mp3","dur":1.601,"text":"Oto siewca wyszedł siać.","words":[[0,0.271],[0.271,0.736],[0.736,1.265],[1.265,1.601]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":1,"file":"06.mp3","dur":2.388,"text":"A gdy siał, jedno padło na drogę;","words":[[0,0.169],[0.169,0.49],[0.49,0.889],[1.108,1.472],[1.472,1.836],[1.836,2.024],[2.024,2.388]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":2,"file":"07.mp3","dur":2.469,"text":"i przyleciały ptaki, i wydziobały je.","words":[[0,0.141],[0.141,0.924],[0.924,1.323],[1.542,1.665],[1.665,2.29],[2.29,2.469]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":3,"file":"08.mp3","dur":6.774,"text":"Inne padło na miejsce skaliste, gdzie nie miało wiele ziemi, i wnet wzeszło, bo nie było głęboko w glebie.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.33,0.723],[0.723,0.926],[0.926,1.446],[1.446,2.029],[2.249,2.562],[2.562,2.774],[2.774,3.087],[3.087,3.4],[3.4,3.713],[3.931,4.062],[4.062,4.372],[4.372,4.861],[5.078,5.257],[5.257,5.493],[5.493,5.785],[5.785,6.246],[6.246,6.369],[6.369,6.774]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":4,"file":"09.mp3","dur":4.08,"text":"Lecz po wschodzie słońca przypaliło się i nie mając korzenia, uschło.","words":[[0,0.269],[0.269,0.435],[0.435,0.963],[0.963,1.336],[1.336,1.916],[1.916,2.133],[2.133,2.247],[2.247,2.464],[2.464,2.785],[2.785,3.262],[3.48,4.08]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":5,"file":"10.mp3","dur":4.03,"text":"Inne znów padło między ciernie, a ciernie wybujały i zagłuszyły je,","words":[[0,0.304],[0.304,0.608],[0.608,0.971],[0.971,1.391],[1.391,1.871],[2.087,2.205],[2.205,2.645],[2.645,3.139],[3.139,3.257],[3.257,3.859],[3.859,4.03]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":6,"file":"11.mp3","dur":1.478,"text":"tak że nie wydało owocu.","words":[[0,0.248],[0.248,0.437],[0.437,0.686],[0.686,1.111],[1.111,1.478]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":7,"file":"12.mp3","dur":3.828,"text":"Inne w końcu padły na ziemię żyzną, wzeszły, wyrosły","words":[[0,0.286],[0.286,0.407],[0.407,0.747],[0.747,1.088],[1.088,1.264],[1.264,1.659],[1.659,2],[2.22,2.945],[3.163,3.828]]},{"sid":"sower","bi":8,"file":"13.mp3","dur":4.607,"text":"i wydały plon: trzydziestokrotny, sześćdziesięciokrotny i stokrotny».","words":[[0,0.152],[0.152,0.65],[0.65,1.01],[1.221,2.326],[2.549,3.869],[3.869,4],[4,4.607]]},{"sid":"ears","bi":0,"file":"14.mp3","dur":0.628,"text":"I dodał:","words":[[0,0.164],[0.164,0.628]]},{"sid":"ears","bi":1,"file":"15.mp3","dur":2.581,"text":"«Kto ma uszy do słuchania, niechaj słucha!».","words":[[0,0.231],[0.231,0.407],[0.407,0.693],[0.693,0.869],[0.869,1.43],[1.647,2.144],[2.144,2.581]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":0,"file":"16.mp3","dur":6.152,"text":"A gdy był sam, pytali Go ci, którzy przy Nim byli, razem z Dwunastoma, o przypowieść.","words":[[0,0.147],[0.147,0.427],[0.427,0.708],[0.708,0.988],[1.211,1.665],[1.665,1.866],[1.866,2.068],[2.287,2.649],[2.649,2.91],[2.91,3.121],[3.121,3.382],[3.6,4.019],[4.019,4.168],[4.168,4.924],[5.142,5.296],[5.296,6.152]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":1,"file":"17.mp3","dur":3.844,"text":"On im odrzekł: «Wam dana jest tajemnica królestwa Bożego,","words":[[0,0.217],[0.217,0.435],[0.435,0.991],[1.208,1.47],[1.47,1.795],[1.795,2.12],[2.12,2.757],[2.757,3.394],[3.394,3.844]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":2,"file":"18.mp3","dur":4.916,"text":"dla tych zaś, którzy są poza wami, wszystko dzieje się w przypowieściach,","words":[[0,0.315],[0.315,0.704],[0.704,1.019],[1.242,1.675],[1.675,1.867],[1.867,2.179],[2.179,2.491],[2.721,3.239],[3.239,3.644],[3.644,3.88],[3.88,4.004],[4.004,4.916]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":3,"file":"19.mp3","dur":4.658,"text":"aby patrzyli oczami, a nie widzieli, słuchali uszami, a nie rozumieli,","words":[[0,0.257],[0.257,0.821],[0.821,1.262],[1.477,1.582],[1.582,1.782],[1.782,2.22],[2.451,3.085],[3.085,3.582],[3.798,3.912],[3.912,4.13],[4.13,4.658]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":4,"file":"20.mp3","dur":3.054,"text":"żeby się nie nawrócili i nie była im wydana tajemnica».","words":[[0,0.284],[0.284,0.513],[0.513,0.742],[0.742,1.298],[1.298,1.418],[1.418,1.647],[1.647,1.931],[1.931,2.105],[2.105,2.498],[2.498,3.054]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":5,"file":"21.mp3","dur":2.763,"text":"I mówił im: «Nie rozumiecie tej przypowieści?","words":[[0,0.13],[0.13,0.497],[0.497,0.686],[0.902,1.141],[1.141,1.776],[1.776,2.014],[2.014,2.763]]},{"sid":"secret","bi":6,"file":"22.mp3","dur":2.335,"text":"Jakże zrozumiecie inne przypowieści?","words":[[0,0.393],[0.393,1.167],[1.167,1.497],[1.497,2.335]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":0,"file":"23.mp3","dur":1.271,"text":"Siewca sieje słowo.","words":[[0,0.467],[0.467,0.869],[0.869,1.271]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":1,"file":"24.mp3","dur":3.353,"text":"A oto są ci posiani na drodze: u nich się sieje słowo,","words":[[0,0.128],[0.128,0.372],[0.372,0.558],[0.558,0.743],[0.743,1.22],[1.22,1.406],[1.406,1.824],[2.044,2.164],[2.164,2.448],[2.448,2.677],[2.677,3.015],[3.015,3.353]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":2,"file":"25.mp3","dur":4.477,"text":"a skoro je usłyszą, zaraz przychodzi szatan i porywa słowo zasiane w nich.","words":[[0,0.136],[0.136,0.518],[0.518,0.715],[0.715,1.22],[1.44,1.777],[1.777,2.387],[2.387,2.779],[2.779,2.899],[2.899,3.291],[3.291,3.628],[3.628,4.075],[4.075,4.194],[4.194,4.477]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":3,"file":"26.mp3","dur":7.318,"text":"Podobnie na miejscach skalistych posiani są ci, którzy, gdy usłyszą słowo, natychmiast przyjmują je z radością,","words":[[0,0.517],[0.517,0.697],[0.697,1.271],[1.271,1.9],[1.9,2.361],[2.361,2.541],[2.541,2.721],[2.934,2.988],[3.079,3.168],[3.168,3.342],[3.342,3.474],[3.692,4.888],[4.888,5.887],[5.887,6.201],[6.201,6.417],[6.417,7.318]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":4,"file":"27.mp3","dur":2.447,"text":"lecz nie mają w sobie korzenia i są niestali.","words":[[0,0.272],[0.272,0.491],[0.491,0.763],[0.763,0.878],[0.878,1.202],[1.202,1.683],[1.683,1.798],[1.798,1.966],[1.966,2.447]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":5,"file":"28.mp3","dur":5.1,"text":"Gdy potem przyjdzie ucisk lub prześladowanie z powodu słowa, zaraz się załamują.","words":[[0,0.241],[0.241,0.597],[0.597,1.182],[1.182,1.538],[1.538,1.779],[1.779,2.651],[2.651,2.777],[2.777,3.19],[3.19,3.546],[3.763,4.186],[4.186,4.473],[4.473,5.1]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":6,"file":"29.mp3","dur":5.596,"text":"Są inni, którzy są zasiani między ciernie: to są ci, którzy słuchają wprawdzie słowa,","words":[[0,0.256],[0.256,0.673],[0.886,1.284],[1.284,1.461],[1.461,1.915],[1.915,2.313],[2.313,2.766],[2.986,3.188],[3.188,3.39],[3.39,3.592],[3.804,4.197],[4.197,4.7],[4.7,5.257],[5.257,5.596]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":7,"file":"30.mp3","dur":4.622,"text":"lecz troski tego świata, ułuda bogactwa i inne żądze wciskają się","words":[[0,0.337],[0.337,0.803],[0.803,1.14],[1.14,1.606],[1.824,2.233],[2.233,2.84],[2.84,2.985],[2.985,3.328],[3.328,3.737],[3.737,4.345],[4.345,4.622]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":8,"file":"31.mp3","dur":3.172,"text":"i zagłuszają słowo, tak że zostaje bezowocne.","words":[[0,0.141],[0.141,0.86],[0.86,1.259],[1.475,1.751],[1.751,1.962],[1.962,2.501],[2.501,3.172]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":9,"file":"32.mp3","dur":5.055,"text":"W końcu na ziemię żyzną zostali posiani ci, którzy słuchają słowa, przyjmują je","words":[[0,0.123],[0.123,0.471],[0.471,0.65],[0.65,1.054],[1.054,1.402],[1.402,1.861],[1.861,2.321],[2.321,2.501],[2.713,3.136],[3.136,3.677],[3.677,4.042],[4.261,4.865],[4.865,5.055]]},{"sid":"explain","bi":10,"file":"33.mp3","dur":4.636,"text":"i wydają owoc: trzydziestokrotny, sześćdziesięciokrotny i stokrotny».","words":[[0,0.153],[0.153,0.656],[0.656,1.019],[1.25,2.356],[2.579,3.899],[3.899,4.03],[4.03,4.636]]},{"sid":"lamp","bi":0,"file":"34.mp3","dur":5.726,"text":"Mówił im dalej: «Czy po to wnosi się światło, by je postawić pod korcem lub pod łóżkiem?","words":[[0,0.415],[0.415,0.629],[0.629,1.044],[1.276,1.504],[1.504,1.678],[1.678,1.852],[1.852,2.189],[2.189,2.417],[2.417,2.863],[3.081,3.275],[3.275,3.469],[3.469,4.027],[4.027,4.282],[4.282,4.719],[4.719,4.973],[4.973,5.228],[5.228,5.726]]},{"sid":"lamp","bi":1,"file":"35.mp3","dur":2.745,"text":"Czy nie po to, aby je postawić na świeczniku?","words":[[0,0.205],[0.205,0.411],[0.411,0.567],[0.567,0.724],[0.937,1.182],[1.182,1.368],[1.368,1.905],[1.905,2.091],[2.091,2.745]]},{"sid":"lamp","bi":2,"file":"36.mp3","dur":3.602,"text":"Nie ma bowiem nic ukrytego, co by nie miało wyjść na jaw.","words":[[0,0.243],[0.243,0.429],[0.429,0.846],[0.846,1.089],[1.089,1.622],[1.839,2.024],[2.024,2.21],[2.21,2.453],[2.453,2.813],[2.813,3.173],[3.173,3.358],[3.358,3.602]]},{"sid":"lamp","bi":3,"file":"37.mp3","dur":2.581,"text":"Kto ma uszy do słuchania, niechaj słucha!».","words":[[0,0.231],[0.231,0.407],[0.407,0.693],[0.693,0.869],[0.869,1.43],[1.647,2.144],[2.144,2.581]]},{"sid":"measure","bi":0,"file":"38.mp3","dur":3.193,"text":"I mówił im: «Uważajcie na to, czego słuchacie.","words":[[0,0.13],[0.13,0.497],[0.497,0.686],[0.903,1.557],[1.557,1.762],[1.762,1.967],[2.203,2.577],[2.577,3.193]]},{"sid":"measure","bi":1,"file":"39.mp3","dur":4.425,"text":"Taką samą miarą, jaką wy mierzycie, odmierzą wam i jeszcze wam dołożą.","words":[[0,0.339],[0.339,0.679],[0.679,1.083],[1.305,1.597],[1.597,1.777],[1.777,2.351],[2.57,3.055],[3.055,3.276],[3.276,3.392],[3.392,3.824],[3.824,4.046],[4.046,4.425]]},{"sid":"measure","bi":2,"file":"40.mp3","dur":1.965,"text":"Bo kto ma, temu będzie dane;","words":[[0,0.23],[0.23,0.531],[0.531,0.761],[0.978,1.269],[1.269,1.673],[1.673,1.965]]},{"sid":"measure","bi":3,"file":"41.mp3","dur":2.878,"text":"a kto nie ma, pozbawią go i tego, co ma».","words":[[0,0.12],[0.12,0.349],[0.349,0.579],[0.579,0.753],[0.973,1.522],[1.522,1.714],[1.714,1.845],[1.845,2.156],[2.378,2.628],[2.628,2.878]]},{"sid":"growing","bi":0,"file":"42.mp3","dur":5.934,"text":"Mówił dalej: «Z królestwem Bożym dzieje się tak, jak gdyby ktoś nasienie wrzucił w ziemię.","words":[[0,0.447],[0.447,0.894],[1.111,1.237],[1.237,1.878],[1.878,2.233],[2.233,2.645],[2.645,2.885],[2.885,3.126],[3.221,3.49],[3.49,3.886],[3.886,4.219],[4.219,4.808],[4.808,5.332],[5.332,5.473],[5.473,5.934]]},{"sid":"growing","bi":1,"file":"43.mp3","dur":2.69,"text":"Czy śpi, czy czuwa, we dnie i w nocy","words":[[0,0.151],[0.151,0.301],[0.399,0.507],[0.507,0.665],[0.901,1.219],[1.219,1.736],[1.736,1.954],[1.954,2.173],[2.173,2.69]]},{"sid":"growing","bi":2,"file":"44.mp3","dur":3.035,"text":"nasienie kiełkuje i rośnie, on sam nie wie jak.","words":[[0,0.548],[0.548,1.097],[1.097,1.228],[1.228,1.657],[1.877,2.062],[2.062,2.306],[2.306,2.549],[2.549,2.792],[2.792,3.035]]},{"sid":"growing","bi":3,"file":"45.mp3","dur":1.94,"text":"Ziemia sama z siebie wydaje plon,","words":[[0,0.408],[0.408,0.703],[0.703,0.828],[0.828,1.237],[1.237,1.645],[1.645,1.94]]},{"sid":"growing","bi":4,"file":"46.mp3","dur":4.282,"text":"najpierw źdźbło, potem kłos, a potem pełne ziarnko w kłosie.","words":[[0,0.54],[0.54,0.962],[1.18,1.692],[1.692,2.121],[2.355,2.487],[2.487,2.858],[2.858,3.229],[3.229,3.72],[3.72,3.851],[3.851,4.282]]},{"sid":"growing","bi":5,"file":"47.mp3","dur":5.209,"text":"A gdy stan zboża na to pozwala, zaraz zapuszcza się sierp, bo pora już na żniwo».","words":[[0,0.128],[0.128,0.373],[0.373,0.677],[0.677,1.039],[1.039,1.225],[1.225,1.412],[1.412,1.89],[2.11,2.434],[2.434,2.966],[2.966,3.185],[3.185,3.508],[3.642,3.87],[3.87,4.24],[4.24,4.539],[4.539,4.767],[4.767,5.209]]},{"sid":"mustard","bi":0,"file":"48.mp3","dur":5.42,"text":"Mówił jeszcze: «Z czym porównamy królestwo Boże lub w jakiej przypowieści je przedstawimy?","words":[[0,0.38],[0.38,0.882],[1.1,1.224],[1.224,1.519],[1.519,2.098],[2.098,2.676],[2.676,2.971],[2.971,3.209],[3.209,3.334],[3.334,3.742],[3.742,4.49],[4.49,4.672],[4.672,5.42]]},{"sid":"mustard","bi":1,"file":"49.mp3","dur":1.908,"text":"Jest ono jak ziarnko gorczycy;","words":[[0,0.32],[0.32,0.579],[0.579,0.837],[0.837,1.342],[1.342,1.908]]},{"sid":"mustard","bi":2,"file":"50.mp3","dur":4.338,"text":"gdy się je wsiewa w ziemię, jest najmniejsze ze wszystkich nasion na ziemi.","words":[[0,0.217],[0.217,0.434],[0.434,0.6],[0.6,0.972],[0.972,1.086],[1.086,1.458],[1.68,1.965],[1.965,2.635],[2.635,2.811],[2.811,3.426],[3.426,3.822],[3.822,3.997],[3.997,4.338]]},{"sid":"mustard","bi":3,"file":"51.mp3","dur":2.817,"text":"Lecz wsiane wyrasta i staje się większe od jarzyn;","words":[[0,0.283],[0.283,0.674],[0.674,1.12],[1.12,1.24],[1.24,1.577],[1.577,1.806],[1.806,2.252],[2.252,2.426],[2.426,2.817]]},{"sid":"mustard","bi":4,"file":"52.mp3","dur":4.526,"text":"wypuszcza wielkie gałęzie, tak że ptaki powietrzne gnieżdżą się w jego cieniu».","words":[[0,0.613],[0.613,1.106],[1.106,1.598],[1.818,2.033],[2.033,2.197],[2.197,2.515],[2.515,3.09],[3.09,3.562],[3.562,3.777],[3.777,3.89],[3.89,4.157],[4.157,4.526]]},{"sid":"conclusion","bi":0,"file":"53.mp3","dur":2.791,"text":"W wielu takich pr